#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:11
msgid "Manage Asset Downloads"
msgstr "管理资产下载"

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:13
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab assets are hosted on AWS S3 and are downloaded as a workflow needs"
" them. Use this guide to cache frequently used assets, migrate an existing "
"Nucleus setup, or select the regional asset service for mainland China."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 资产托管于 AWS S3，并在工作流需要时下载。本指南介绍如何缓存常用资产、迁移现有 Nucleus "
"配置，以及选择面向中国大陆的区域资产服务。"

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:19
msgid "Cache remote assets"
msgstr "缓存远程资产"

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:21
msgid ""
"Enable Hub Workstation Cache when repeated downloads are slow or the "
"workstation has intermittent network access."
msgstr "如果重复下载较慢，或工作站的网络连接时断时续，可启用 Hub Workstation Cache。"

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:24
msgid "Launch Isaac Sim:"
msgstr "启动 Isaac Sim："

