#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:0
msgid "Asset Caching"
msgstr "资产缓存"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:3
msgid ""
"Assets used in Isaac Lab are hosted on AWS S3 buckets on the cloud. Asset "
"loading time can depend on your network connection and geographical "
"location. In some cases, it is possible that asset loading times can be long"
" when assets are pulled from the AWS servers."
msgstr ""
"在 Isaac Lab 中使用的资产托管在云上的 AWS S3 存储桶中。资产加载时间可能会依赖于您的网络连接和地理位置。在某些情况下，从 AWS "
"服务器拉取资产时，资产加载时间可能会很长。"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:7
msgid ""
"If you run into cases where assets take a few minutes to load for each run, "
"we recommend enabling asset caching following the below steps."
msgstr "如果在每次运行时遇到资源加载需要几分钟的情况，我们建议按照以下步骤启用资源缓存。"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:10
msgid "First, launch the Isaac Sim application:"
msgstr "首先，启动 Isaac Sim 应用程序:"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:29
msgid ""
"On the top right of the Isaac Lab or Isaac Sim app, look for the icon "
"labeled ``CACHE:``. You may see a message such as ``HUB NOT DETECTED`` or "
"``NEW VERSION DETECTED``."
msgstr ""
"在 Isaac Lab 或 Isaac Sim 应用程序的右上角，查找标有 ``CACHE:`` 图标。您可能会看到消息，例如 ``HUB NOT "
"DETECTED`` 或 ``NEW VERSION DETECTED`` 。"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:32
msgid ""
"Click the message to enable `Hub "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/utilities/latest/cache/hub-"
"workstation.html>`_. Hub automatically manages local caching for Isaac Lab "
"assets, so subsequent runs will use cached files instead of downloading from"
" AWS each time."
msgstr ""
"点击消息以启用 `Hub <https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/utilities/latest/cache/hub-"
"workstation.html>`_ 。Hub 会自动管理 Isaac 实验室资产的本地缓存，因此后续运行将使用缓存文件而不是每次从 AWS 下载。"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:36
msgid "Simulator with cache messaging."
msgstr "带有缓存消息的仿真器"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:41
msgid ""
"Hub provides better control and management of cached assets, making "
"workflows faster and more reliable, especially in environments with limited "
"or intermittent internet access."
msgstr "Hub 提供更好的控制和管理缓存资产，使工作流程更快和更可靠，特别是在网络访问受限或不稳定的环境中。"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:45
msgid ""
"The first time you run Isaac Lab, assets will still need to be pulled from "
"the cloud, which could lead to longer loading times.  Once cached, loading "
"times will be significantly reduced on subsequent runs."
msgstr "第一次运行 Isaac Lab 时，仍然需要从云端拉取资产，这可能会导致更长的加载时间。一旦缓存，后续运行时加载时间将显著减少。"

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:0
msgid "Using a Local Asset Root"
msgstr "使用本地资产根目录"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:50
msgid ""
"Machines that are air-gapped or otherwise unable to reach the AWS S3 buckets"
" can point Isaac Lab at a local or self-hosted copy of the assets. Set the "
"``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` environment variable before launching:"
msgstr ""
"对于隔离网络或无法访问 AWS S3 存储桶的机器，可让 Isaac Lab 使用本地或自行托管的资产副本。启动前设置 "
"``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` 环境变量："

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:71
msgid ""
"The variable must point at the versioned asset root, that is the directory "
"containing ``Isaac`` and ``NVIDIA``. It takes precedence over the value "
"shipped in the experience files, and it always applies to the Isaac Lab "
"asset paths such as :attr:`~isaaclab.utils.assets.ISAAC_NUCLEUS_DIR`. The "
"Isaac Sim asset root resolves to the same value when you use one of the "
"provided Isaac Lab experiences, because those load "
"``isaacsim.storage.native``. A custom experience that does not build on one "
"of them may leave the Isaac Sim asset root pointing at the cloud."
msgstr ""
"该变量必须指向带版本号的资产根目录，即包含 ``Isaac`` 和 ``NVIDIA`` 的目录。它优先于 experience "
"文件中的值，且始终适用于 :attr:`~isaaclab.utils.assets.ISAAC_NUCLEUS_DIR` 等 Isaac Lab "
"资产路径。使用 Isaac Lab 提供的 experience 时，由于它们加载 ``isaacsim.storage.native`` ，Isaac"
" Sim 资产根目录也会解析为同一值。未基于这些 experience 的自定义 experience，可能仍使 Isaac Sim "
"资产根目录指向云端。"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:78
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports the ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` and "
"``ISAACSIM_ASSET_REGION_PROFILE`` environment variables for runtime asset "
"selection. It resolves asset paths once, when :mod:`isaaclab.utils.assets` "
"is imported, so setting ``persistent.isaac.asset_root.default`` on the "
"command line or changing it at runtime does not move them, even though Isaac"
" Sim itself honors those forms. Editing "
"``persistent.isaac.asset_root.default`` in the experience file does work, "
"because that is the value Isaac Lab reads when the variable is unset."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持通过 ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` 和 ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_REGION_PROFILE`` "
"环境变量选择运行时资产。资产路径只在导入 :mod:`isaaclab.utils.assets` 时解析一次，因此在命令行设置 "
"``persistent.isaac.asset_root.default`` ，或在运行中修改它，都不会改变这些路径，尽管 Isaac Sim "
"本身支持这两种方式。在 experience 文件中修改 ``persistent.isaac.asset_root.default`` "
"则有效，因为环境变量未设置时，Isaac Lab 会读取该值。"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:85
msgid ""
"If you previously redirected Isaac Lab assets by editing "
"``persistent.isaac.asset_root.cloud`` in an experience file, that edit no "
"longer has any effect. Isaac Lab now reads "
"``persistent.isaac.asset_root.default`` first, and the shipped experiences "
"leave it pointing at the cloud. Set ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` instead, or edit"
" ``persistent.isaac.asset_root.default``."
msgstr ""
"如果此前通过修改 experience 文件中的 ``persistent.isaac.asset_root.cloud`` 重定向 Isaac Lab"
" 资产，现在该修改已不再生效。Isaac Lab 现在首先读取 ``persistent.isaac.asset_root.default`` "
"，而随附的 experience 将其指向云端。请改为设置 ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` ，或修改 "
"``persistent.isaac.asset_root.default`` 。"

#: source/setup/installation/asset_caching_details.inc:90
msgid ""
"For instructions on downloading the asset pack, see the `Isaac Sim asset "
"documentation "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_faq.html#isaac-"
"sim-setup-assets-content-pack>`__."
msgstr ""
"资产包下载说明见 `Isaac Sim 资产文档 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_faq.html#isaac-"
"sim-setup-assets-content-pack>`__ 。"

