"Nucleus 设置将继续工作，因此如果您已经配置了本地 Nucleus 服务器，可以继续使用它。"

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:56
msgid ""
"Omniverse Nucleus and Omniverse Launcher are deprecated starting with Isaac "
"Sim 4.5. Existing local Nucleus installations continue to work."
msgstr ""
"从 Isaac Sim 4.5 开始，Omniverse Nucleus 和 Omniverse Launcher 已弃用。现有的本地 Nucleus "
"安装仍可使用。"

