#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:79
msgid ""
"Set the profile before launching Isaac Lab. Clear ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` "
"first because an explicit asset-root override takes precedence over the "
"selected profile."
