#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:101
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab launchers and asset helpers apply the profile automatically. The "
"same variable also selects the profile when Isaac Lab launches Isaac Sim. In"
" kit-less mode, Isaac Lab configures the required ``omni.client`` routing "
"without requiring Isaac Sim."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 启动器和资产工具会自动应用区域配置。Isaac Lab 启动 Isaac Sim 时，同一变量也会选择相应配置。在不依赖 Kit "
"的模式下，Isaac Lab 无需 Isaac Sim 即可配置所需的 ``omni.client`` 路由。"

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:105
msgid ""
"A standalone kit-less script that calls ``omni.client`` before launching an "
"Isaac Lab runtime must initialize the profile first:"
msgstr "如果独立的不依赖 Kit 的脚本在启动 Isaac Lab 运行时之前就调用 ``omni.client`` ，则必须先初始化区域配置："

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:114
msgid ""
"To return to the primary service, clear ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` and select "
"the ``us`` profile."
msgstr "要恢复主要服务，清除 ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` ，并选择 ``us`` 区域配置。"

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:116
msgid ""
"The ``china`` profile publishes an `asset availability manifest "
"<https://assets.simready.cn/manifests/isaac/6.1/asset-availability.csv>`__. "
"The ``isaac_version`` field identifies the asset release. Each "
"``asset_path`` is the full path to a file relative to the versioned asset "
"root's ``Isaac`` directory. A ``status`` value of ``available`` reports that"
" the file is mirrored, ``reason_code`` explains other statuses when "
"provided, and ``checked_at`` records when the status last changed. A path "
"with no row is not mirrored. The manifest does not confirm the availability "
"of paths outside the root's ``Isaac`` directory."
msgstr ""
"``china`` 配置提供 `资产可用性清单 "
"<https://assets.simready.cn/manifests/isaac/6.1/asset-availability.csv>`__ 。"
" ``isaac_version`` 字段标识资产发布版本。每个 ``asset_path`` 是相对于带版本号的资产根目录中 ``Isaac`` "
"目录的完整文件路径。 ``status`` 为 ``available`` 表示文件已镜像；若提供 ``reason_code`` ，它会解释其他状态；"
" ``checked_at`` 记录状态最后变化的时间。没有对应行的路径未被镜像。该清单不确认根目录中 ``Isaac`` 目录之外的路径是否可用。"

#: source/how-to/manage_asset_downloads.rst:124
msgid ""
"Build paths from profile-resolved constants such as "
":attr:`~isaaclab.utils.assets.ISAAC_NUCLEUS_DIR` and "
":attr:`~isaaclab.utils.assets.ISAACLAB_NUCLEUS_DIR`. Do not hardcode the "
"profile's storage endpoint or derive direct object URLs from the manifest. "
"Opening an object-storage URL directly in a browser or with ``curl`` can "
"return HTTP 403 because it bypasses the profile's CDN routing."
msgstr ""
"应通过区域配置解析后的常量构建路径，例如 :attr:`~isaaclab.utils.assets.ISAAC_NUCLEUS_DIR` 和 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.utils.assets.ISAACLAB_NUCLEUS_DIR` "
"。不要硬编码区域配置的存储端点，也不要根据清单推导对象的直接 URL。在浏览器或 ``curl`` 中直接打开对象存储 URL，会绕过区域配置的 CDN"
" 路由，可能返回 HTTP 403。"
